From f25ded1def6877cf49fcaf609ad4e86fdb2c5064 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ajaykumar <a.nerurmuthukrishnan@shell.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 18:08:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] NURBS+: add G3 (curvature-rate) continuity to Blend, Match
 and Check

- new pure maths block AakarG3: exact edge derivatives to 3rd order
  (derivative control points + rational quotient rule), arc-length jets,
  degree-7 Hermite end conditions, G3 match row
- Blend: G3 option builds degree-7 cross sections (mixes with G0-G2 sides)
- Match: G3 solves the 4th control row (needs >= 5 rows, degree >= 3)
- Check: curvature-rate difference readout + sparkline, G3 verdict (blue)
- test/nurbs-g3.mjs (in npm test): exact derivatives vs finite differences on
  all four edges, cylinder r''' = -T/R^2, Hermite ends, match row
- docs: NURBS_PLUS.md, WHATS_NEW_8_12.md

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MvLybUGZkdXhnZxC5CmdGQ
